---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Quick Pace Calc">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-title">
      <img src="/pace-calc-icon.png" alt="Quick Pace Calc" class="app-icon" />
      <h1>Quick Pace Calc</h1>
    </div>
    <ul class="header-links">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/chadheise/pace-calc">Source (GitHub)</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/chadheise/pace-calc/issues">Support</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pace-calc/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p>
    Quick Pace Calc is an iOS app that allows you to easily convert running
    times to a variety of formats.
  </p>
  <p>
    For example, if you ran 5.3 miles in 46 min and 37 sec, Quick Pace Calc will
    quickly show you pace in min/mile and min/km as well as how long it would
    take you to complete common race distances at that pace such as 5k, 10k and
    more!
  </p>
  <h2>Screenshots</h2>
  <div class="screenshot-container">
    <img src="/pace-calc-screenshot.png" alt="Quick Pace Calc screenshot" />
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .header-links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .screenshot-container {
    max-width: 400px;
  }
  .screenshot-container img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
